{"id":"613509","name":"咸肉芥菜芋艿炒饭","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/613509/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"咸肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"毛芋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芥菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"咸肉、鲜肉切片。","img":"images/613509/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"萝卜芥菜清洗。","img":"images/613509/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"芋艿去皮洗净。","img":"images/613509/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"芋艿切滚刀块、萝卜擦成丝。","img":"images/613509/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"芥菜切细。","img":"images/613509/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉片放入锅中小火煸炒出油。","img":"images/613509/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入芋艿、萝卜丝翻炒几分钟。","img":"images/613509/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入芥菜梗翻炒。","img":"images/613509/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入米饭，加少许水焖烧。","img":"images/613509/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入芥菜叶子，继续烧至芋艿软熟。","img":"images/613509/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加盐、生抽调味炒匀。","img":"images/613509/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"肉香味浓，滑糯可口。","img":"images/613509/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}